        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>◆ </i>Please note: Multiple AMD users have reported game stuttering. Workaround: Disable AMD's anti-lag feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/73d884ead8152ef07fa5bbcc6c9f53e2.avif?t=1777203108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Defeat enemies to obtain equipment and runes of different color qualities. The entries and values of the equipment change randomly. Among them, purple equipment is the rarest, with 4 entries and the highest value multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/03d5810b717ace78657f4ce4f1ea74b2.avif?t=1777203108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Equipment can be enhanced and upgraded at merchants, with each piece of equipment being enhanced up to 10 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/465e1565deb2c2c413576ade375661aa.avif?t=1777203108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Runes are used to craft rune word equipment, which is the most powerful type of equipment in the game and brings a huge leap in the character's strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>◆ </i>Please note: Multiple AMD users have reported game stuttering. Workaround: Disable AMD's anti-lag feature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/73d884ead8152ef07fa5bbcc6c9f53e2.avif?t=1777203108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Defeat enemies to obtain equipment and runes of different color qualities. The entries and values of the equipment change randomly. Among them, purple equipment is the rarest, with 4 entries and the highest value multiplier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/03d5810b717ace78657f4ce4f1ea74b2.avif?t=1777203108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Equipment can be enhanced and upgraded at merchants, with each piece of equipment being enhanced up to 10 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951430/extras/465e1565deb2c2c413576ade375661aa.avif?t=1777203108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Runes are used to craft rune word equipment, which is the most powerful type of equipment in the game and brings a huge leap in the character's strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
